calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.michael.gr/post/2025-06-code-review-images/media/nooo/sheldon-cooper-nooo-320.jpg" width="320"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="429px" data-flex-grow="178" height="179" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.michael.gr/post/2025-06-code-review-images/media/nooo/schwarzeneger-nooo-320.jpg" width="320"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="201px" data-flex-grow="83" height="298" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.michael.gr/post/2025-06-code-review-images/media/nooo/lady-nooo.jpg" width="250"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="371px" data-flex-grow="154" height="207" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.michael.gr/post/2025-06-code-review-images/media/piccard-no-just-no-320.jpg" width="320"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="426px" data-flex-grow="177" height="180" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.michael.gr/post/2025-06-code-review-images/media/gandalf-you-shall-not-pass-320.jpg" width="320"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>The best code review comment ever</title><link>https://blog.michael.gr/post/2025-02-the-best-code-review-comment-ever/</link><pubDate>Mon, 10 Feb 2025 11:30:14 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.michael.gr/post/2025-02-the-best-code-review-comment-ever/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="360px" data-flex-grow="150" height="1024" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.michael.gr/post/2025-02-the-best-code-review-comment-ever/media/code-review.jpg" width="1536"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;I just wrote a code review comment that I feel particularly smug about.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;The code I was reviewing:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt; class PointClouds ...&#10;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;My comment:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#13;&#10; &lt;blockquote&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;p&gt;It is a bad idea to have a type name in plural. If you need to signify plurality, use a plurality-signifying suffix in singular form, as in:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;PointCloudCollection&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;PointCloudSet&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;PointCloudGroup&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;or go creative with &lt;code&gt;PointCloudFormation&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;or take creativity to a whole new level with &lt;code&gt;PointCumulonimbus&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Anything but a plural type name.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#13;&#10; &lt;/blockquote&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;p&gt;To save the reader from copying and pasting, here is &lt;a class="external" &#13;&#10; href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cumulonimbus_cloud" target="_blank"&#13;&#10; &gt;Cumulonimbus on Wikipedia&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Cover image created by ChatGpt using the following prompt: &amp;quot;Please give me an illustration conveying the concept of &amp;quot;code review&amp;quot;. Make it in landscape format, with clean colors.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Old comments&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Anonymous 2025-02-16 23:28:05 UTC&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;I have never heard of Cumulonimbus before but that sounds cool, going to use this for all my classes from now on&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Anonymous 2025-02-16 23:31:24 UTC&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;(/s) This is a good one! Sound advice in multiple ways 😂&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>